\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Executed reconstruction pipeline. Unmodified conditions pass lengths directly to segmentation. Candidate scores include the first EOS and exclude all subsequent padding before each context update (Section\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {sec:reconstructor}); the first segment has no reconstructed context. Main and verified-reference runs request all segments with three samples per segment; 96-token pilots allow up to three segments with three samples each; the five-seed MAP study uses one sample for the first segment per seed. The 80-token encoder limit includes the instruction and context. All settings score their output against the full stored response.\relax }}{7}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{2}{7}{Executed reconstruction pipeline. Unmodified conditions pass lengths directly to segmentation. Candidate scores include the first EOS and exclude all subsequent padding before each context update (Section~\ref {sec:reconstructor}); the first segment has no reconstructed context. Main and verified-reference runs request all segments with three samples per segment; 96-token pilots allow up to three segments with three samples each; the five-seed MAP study uses one sample for the first segment per seed. The 80-token encoder limit includes the instruction and context. All settings score their output against the full stored response.\relax }{figure.caption.2}{}}
